---
layout: base.njk
title: Categories
description: 학습하고 기록하는 6개의 연구 분야입니다.
permalink: /categories/
---
<header class="page-heading" data-reveal>
  <p class="section-kicker">RESEARCH AREAS</p>
  <h1>Categories</h1>
  <p>{{ description }} 관심 있는 분야의 글을 모아 볼 수 있습니다.</p>
</header>
<ol class="topic-directory" data-reveal>
  {% for category in topics %}{% set categoryPosts = collections.posts | inCategory(category.name) %}
  <li>
    <a href="/categories/{{ category.slug }}/">
      <span class="topic-icon">{% include 'category-icon.njk' %}</span>
      <span class="topic-name"><small>{{ category.label }}</small><strong>{{ category.name }}</strong><span>{{ category.description }}</span></span>
      <span class="topic-count">{{ categoryPosts | length }}개의 기록</span>
      <span class="topic-arrow" aria-hidden="true">›</span>
    </a>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ol>
